#: ../src/audio_provider_factory.cpp:350
msgid ""
"Unable to create RAM audio cache: 32-bit memory limit exceeded. Fallback to "
"hard disk cache.\n"
"\n"
"Possible solutions:\n"
"- Use 64-bit version\n"
"- Turn off cache or switch to hard disk cache in Preferences -> Advanced -> "
"Audio -> Cache -> Cache type\n"
"- Enable channel downmix in Preferences -> Advanced -> Audio"
msgstr ""
"无法创建内存音频缓存：超出 32 位内存限制，已回退到硬盘缓存。\n"
"\n"
"可行办法：\n"
"- 使用 64 位版本\n"
"- 在 选项 -> 高级 -> 音频 -> 缓存 -> 缓存类型 中关闭缓存或改为硬盘缓存\n"
"- 在 选项 -> 高级 -> 音频 中启用声道缩混"

