#: ../src/preferences.cpp:449
msgid ""
"When enabled, Style Editor and \\fn selectors display and write the system-"
"localized family name. Both Style Editor and the \\fn Select Font command use "
"Aegisub's custom font selectors. When disabled, both prefer validated English "
"Win32 family names, falling back when unavailable (localized catalog name, or "
"the enumerator list if the catalog is not ready), for better cross-language "
"portability."
msgstr ""
"启用后，样式编辑器和 \\fn 选择器会显示并写入系统本地化家族名。样式编辑器和 \\fn“选择字体”命令都使用 Aegisub "
"的自定义字体选择器。禁用后，二者优先使用已验证的英文 Win32 家族名，不可用时再回退（本地化目录名，或目录未就绪时的枚举列表），以便跨语言移植。"

#: ../src/preferences.cpp:459
msgid "Use contains matching in custom font selectors"
msgstr "自定义字体选择器使用包含匹配"

#: ../src/preferences.cpp:462
msgid ""
"When enabled, typing in Style Editor or the custom Select Font dialog uses "
"contains matching instead of the native prefix matching. Other combo "
"behaviour is unchanged."
msgstr "启用后，在样式编辑器或自定义“选择字体”对话框中输入时使用包含匹配，而不是原生前缀匹配。其他组合框行为不变。"

#: ../src/preferences.cpp:467
msgid "Automatically expand font list while typing"
msgstr "输入时自动展开字体列表"

#: ../src/preferences.cpp:470
msgid ""
"When enabled, typing a matching name in Style Editor or the custom Select "
"Font dialog opens the candidate list automatically. Use the arrow keys and "
"Enter to choose a font without the mouse. Manual font names remain supported."
msgstr ""
"启用后，在样式编辑器或自定义“选择字体”对话框中输入匹配名称时会自动打开候选列表。可用方向键和 Enter 选择字体，无需鼠标。仍支持手动输入字体名。"

#: ../src/preferences.cpp:477
msgid "Compact vertical font list (use Vertical checkbox)"
msgstr "紧凑竖排字体列表（使用“竖排”复选框）"

#: ../src/preferences.cpp:480
msgid ""
"Default is off: custom font lists include both horizontal and GDI '@' "
"vertical face names, similar to the Windows font list.\n"
"\n"
"When enabled, lists show only horizontal family names. A Vertical checkbox "
"appears for families GDI registered with a leading '@'; the face text box "
"still shows the full ASS name (with '@' when vertical is on). Uninstalled "
"fonts keep the typed name; Vertical is disabled when capability cannot be "
"verified."
msgstr ""
"默认关闭：自定义字体列表同时包含横向和 GDI “@” 竖排字体名，类似于 Windows 字体列表。\n"
"\n"
"启用后，列表只显示横向家族名。对 GDI 以 “@” 开头注册的家族会显示“竖排”复选框；字体文本框仍显示完整 ASS 名称（竖排开启时带 "
"“@”）。未安装的字体保留输入名称；无法验证能力时禁用“竖排”。"

