#: aegisub.appdata.xml:1
msgid ""
"A free, cross-platform open source tool for creating and modifying subtitles"
msgstr "免费、跨平台的开源字幕创建与修改工具"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:2
msgid ""
"Aegisub is a free, cross-platform open source tool for creating and modifying "
"subtitles. Aegisub makes it quick and easy to time subtitles to audio, and "
"features many powerful tools for styling them, including a built-in real-time "
"video preview."
msgstr "Aegisub 是一款免费、跨平台的开源字幕创建与修改工具。它可以快速方便地将字幕与音频对轴，并提供许多强大的样式工具，包括内置实时视频预览。"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:3
msgid ""
"Aegisub was originally created as a tool to make typesetting, particularly in "
"anime fansubs, a less painful experience. At the time of the start of the "
"project, many other programs that supported the Advanced Substation Alpha "
"format lacked (and in many cases, still lack; development on several "
"competing programs have since been dropped for various reasons completely "
"unrelated to Aegisub) many vital functions, or were too buggy and/or "
"unreliable to be really useful."
msgstr ""
"Aegisub 最初是为了让排版（尤其是动画字幕组的排版）不那么痛苦而创建的。项目起步时，许多支持 Advanced Substation Alpha "
"格式的其他程序缺少（而且在很多情况下仍然缺少；若干竞争程序后来因与 Aegisub "
"完全无关的原因停止开发）许多关键功能，或者太过不稳定、不可靠，难以真正使用。"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:4
msgid ""
"Since then, Aegisub has grown into a fully fledged, highly customizable "
"subtitle editor. It features a lot of convenient tools to help you with "
"timing, typesetting, editing and translating subtitles, as well as a powerful "
"scripting environment called Automation (originally mostly intended for "
"creating karaoke effects, Automation can now be used much else, including "
"creating macros and various other convenient tools)."
msgstr ""
"此后，Aegisub "
"已成长为功能完备、高度可定制的字幕编辑器。它提供大量便捷工具，帮助你进行对轴、排版、编辑和翻译，以及名为自动化（Automation）的强大脚本环境（最初主"
"要用于卡拉OK特效，现在也可用于创建宏和其他便捷工具）。"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:5
msgid "Some highlights of Aegisub:"
msgstr "Aegisub 的部分亮点："

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:6
msgid "Simple and intuitive yet powerful interface for editing subtitles"
msgstr "简单直观却强大的字幕编辑界面"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:7
msgid "Support for many formats and character sets"
msgstr "支持多种格式和字符集"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:8
msgid "Powerful video mode"
msgstr "强大的视频模式"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:9
msgid "Visual typesetting tools"
msgstr "可视化排版工具"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:10
msgid "Intuitive and customizable audio timing mode"
msgstr "直观且可定制的音频对轴模式"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:11
msgid "Fully scriptable through the Automation module"
msgstr "可通过自动化模块完全脚本化"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:12
msgid "Typesetting"
msgstr "排版"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:13
msgid "Audio video"
msgstr "音频视频"

#: aegisub.appdata.xml:14
msgid "Audio timing"
msgstr "音频对轴"

